00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:19.100
And we're going to go through the process
now that you go through every week when
you're running your watch list, updating
it, and maintaining it.

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:22.540
So, you have to do this.

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:26.480
What I'm going to show you now, you have
to do this for every one of your spreads.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.520
Don't worry about it too much.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:31.140
Once you get used to the processes, it
becomes second nature.

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:34.880
And you end up doing this on a weekly
basis within just a couple of hours.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:40.020
And it adds a lot of value to your life
and adds a lot of value to you as a
trader.

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:42.860
Because it saves you a lot of money and
also makes you a lot of money.

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:52.300
So, first thing we're going to do, we're
going to simulate this idea that it's the
end of the week.

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.040
And you're now updating your watch list.

00:23:57.420 --> 00:24:01.300
And we're going to count five lines.

